WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.836 --> 00:00:06.006
Booth: I was born with the chance
to be somebody.

00:00:07.549 --> 00:00:13.055
I’m gonna be the most famous man
in the whole world.

00:00:15.599 --> 00:00:16.517
Mr. President.

00:00:16.600 --> 00:00:19.645
The Confederacy is dead,
the Union is saved,

00:00:19.728 --> 00:00:21.772
the war is over.

00:00:26.902 --> 00:00:31.156
(Audience cheering)

00:00:31.240 --> 00:00:32.115
(Audience screaming)

00:00:32.199 --> 00:00:34.201
Freedom for the South!

00:00:39.414 --> 00:00:41.416
- What happened?
- President’s been shot.

00:00:41.500 --> 00:00:44.461
Parker: Witnesses are saying
it was John Wilkes Booth.

00:00:44.545 --> 00:00:45.504
Wait, the actor?

00:00:46.213 --> 00:00:49.049
Do you know who I am?
I’m a symbol.

00:00:50.133 --> 00:00:53.512
Stanton: How does a well-known actor
commit murder

00:00:53.595 --> 00:00:57.599
in front of an audience
of 1500 people and escape?

00:00:58.642 --> 00:01:00.185
Find the man that killed my husband.

00:01:03.272 --> 00:01:06.441
Gentleman, I am tasking you
with the capture of John Wilkes Booth.

00:01:07.192 --> 00:01:09.152
♪ All of this can be broken ♪

00:01:09.236 --> 00:01:12.698
♪ Hold your devil by his spoke
And spin him to the ground ♪

00:01:12.781 --> 00:01:15.826
This is a conspiracy
to dismember our government.

00:01:16.368 --> 00:01:17.870
I know who you are, Mr. Booth.

00:01:17.953 --> 00:01:19.329
You gonna help us or not?

00:01:19.955 --> 00:01:23.876
There’s a bounty on the head of Booth,
and I intend to collect.

00:01:25.252 --> 00:01:27.880
Booth is being protected
by the Confederacy.

00:01:29.965 --> 00:01:33.969
Now with Lincoln out of the way,
this country belongs to us.

00:01:35.637 --> 00:01:38.223
I will not surrender!
May God be my judge!

00:01:38.307 --> 00:01:44.271
♪ “Devil's Spoke”
by Laura Marling ♪

00:01:44.897 --> 00:01:46.064
Booth: God bless America.

